### 2. Fichier `styles.css`

```css
/* --- RESET & VARIABLES --- */
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

:root {
    --floor-color: #1a1a1a;
    --ceiling-color: #111;
    --wall-color: #2c3e50;
    --accent-color: #e74c3c;
    --hud-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
}

body {
    background-color: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    perspective: 1000px;
}

/* --- HUD SUPÉRIEUR --- */
.hud-top {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3.5rem;
    background: var(--hud-bg);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-color);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 100;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 0.1rem;
}

.hud-value {
    color: #f1c40f;
}

.hud-value.health {
    color: #2ecc71;
}

/* --- RÉTICULE DE VISEÉ (CROSSHAIR) --- */
.crosshair {
    position: fixed;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 90;
}
.crosshair::before, .crosshair::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.8);
}
.crosshair::before {
    top: 40%;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 20%;
}
.crosshair::after {
    top: 0;
    left: 40%;
    width: 20%;
    height: 100%;
}

/* --- CONTENEUR DE SCÈNE 3D --- */
.scene-container {
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
}

/* Gestion des états de position via les ancres */
.world {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: none; /* Masqué par défaut */
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
}

/* Affichage par défaut de la première salle ou via l'ancre active */
#pos-room1:target,
#pos-room1:not(:has(~ .world:target)) { /* Fallback si aucune ancre active */
    display: block;
}

#pos-room2:target {
    display: block;
}

/* --- STRUCTURE DE LA SALLE (3D CSS) --- */
.room {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transform: translateZ(0);
    transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;
}

.floor, .ceiling, .wall {
    position: absolute;
    background-size: 4rem 4rem;
}

/* Sol */
.floor {
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 60vh;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #111, #222);
    transform: rotateX(90deg);
    transform-origin: bottom;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px #000;
}

/* Plafond */
.ceiling {
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 60vh;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    transform: rotateX(-90deg);
    transform-origin: top;
}

/* Murs Gauche / Droite */
.wall-left {
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 60vw;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a252f, var(--wall-color));
    transform: rotateY(90deg);
    transform-origin: left;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
}

.wall-right {
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 60vw;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(-90deg, #1a252f, var(--wall-color));
    transform: rotateY(-90deg);
    transform-origin: right;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
}

/* --- ENNEMI (SPRITE 3D STATIQUE INTERACTIF) --- */
.enemy {
    position: absolute;
    top: 45%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 8rem;
    height: 12rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateZ(-200px);
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    cursor: crosshair;
}

.enemy-body {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #e74c3c 0%, #962d22 80%);
    clip-path: polygon(30% 0%, 70% 0%, 100% 30%, 80% 100%, 20% 100%, 0% 30%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.6);
}

.enemy-eyes {
    position: absolute;
    top: 25%;
    left: 25%;
    width: 50%;
    height: 1rem;
    background: yellow;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px yellow;
}

/* Boss Salle 2 */
.enemy-boss {
    width: 14rem;
    height: 18rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateZ(-300px);
}
.enemy-boss .enemy-body {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #8e44ad 0%, #341f97 80%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(142, 68, 173, 0.8);
}

/* Effet de tir / élimination purement en CSS (Focus/Active) */
.enemy:focus {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateZ(-200px) scale(0);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: transform 0.1s, opacity 0.1s;
    pointer-events: none;
}
.enemy-boss:focus {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateZ(-300px) scale(0);
}

/* --- PORTES / NAVIGATION --- */
.door {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateZ(-500px);
    width: 10rem;
    height: 15rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, #d35400, #e67e22);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    border: 4px solid #f39c12;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(243, 156, 18, 0.5);
    transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
}

.door:hover {
    background: #e67e22;
    box-shadow: 0 0 50px #f39c12;
}

.door-back {
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateZ(400px) rotateY(180deg);
}

/* --- HUD INFÉRIEUR (ARME FIXE) --- */
.hud-bottom {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 8rem;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: 0 2rem;
}

.weapon {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 12rem;
    height: 10rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
}

.gun-barrel {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 6rem;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #555, #999, #333);
    border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
}

.gun-body {
    width: 8rem;
    height: 4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #444, #111);
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    box-shadow: 0 -5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}

.ammo {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    background: var(--hud-bg);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

/* --- RESPONSIVENESS --- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hud-top {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .weapon {
        width: 8rem;
        height: 7rem;
    }
}
```

### Caractéristiques de la réalisation :
1. **Zéro JavaScript** : La navigation d'une salle à l'autre se fait via les ancres HTML (`#pos-room1` et `#pos-room2`) pilotées par `:target`. La destruction des ennemis utilise l'effet `:focus` interactif au clic de la souris.
2. **Immersion 3D CSS** : Utilisation de `perspective`, `transform-style: preserve-3d`, et de rotations/translations 3D pour simuler l'espace des couloirs et le positionnement des sprites ennemis.
3. **Design HUD & Réticule** : Un HUD supérieur de score/santé, un réticule fixe au centre, et une arme en bas de l'écran pour parfaire l'ambiance rétro-FPS.
